---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#111315" />
    <meta name="description" content="Mustafizur Rahman — full-stack and systems engineering across production commerce, security, performance, and infrastructure." />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Mustafizur Rahman — Residual Signal" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="It worked in staging. Good. Now let real traffic have a go." />
    <title>Mustafizur Rahman — Residual Signal</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;1,6..72,400&family=Noto+Sans+Bengali:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="paper-noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="scroll-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
    <div class="pointer-light" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <canvas class="residue-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="motion-cursor" aria-hidden="true"><span class="motion-cursor__ring"></span><span class="motion-cursor__label">inspect ↗</span></div>
    <aside class="signal-meter" aria-hidden="true"><span class="signal-meter__eyebrow">FIELD STATE</span><strong data-signal-state>STABLE</strong><span class="signal-meter__track"><span data-signal-fill></span></span><small>Move. Scroll. Disturb.</small></aside>

    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="signature" href="#top" aria-label="Mustafizur Rahman, start">
        <span class="signature__mark" aria-hidden="true">m<span>/</span>r</span>
        <span class="signature__text">Mustafizur Rahman<small>Software / systems / sometimes both</small></span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="nav">
        <a href="#work">Work</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="entry" id="top" aria-labelledby="entry-title">
        <div class="entry__margin-note" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>signal found</span>
          <span class="margin-rule"></span>
          <span class="margin-coordinate">23°48' N / 90°24' E</span>
        </div>
        <div class="entry__main">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__pulse"></span> Full-stack & systems engineering <span class="eyebrow__dash">—</span> Dhaka, Bangladesh</p>
          <h1 id="entry-title" class="distortable" data-alien="true">It worked in staging<span class="entry__period">.</span></h1>
          <div class="entry__followup">
            <p class="entry__answer">Good. Now let real traffic have a go.</p>
            <p class="entry__bangla distortable" lang="bn" data-alien="true">সব ঠিক থাকলে কেউ দেখে না।</p>
            <p class="entry__translation">When everything works, nobody notices.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="entry__body">I work across commerce, checkout, security, databases, and Linux infrastructure. Usually where one small failure has a way of becoming everyone's problem.</p>
          <div class="entry__links">
            <a class="link-underline" href="#work">Look at the work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
            <a class="link-muted" href="https://github.com/Xbot-me" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Source is public where it can be <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="entry__field" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="signal-field" viewBox="0 0 540 560" fill="none">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="signal-warm" x1="74" y1="75" x2="421" y2="444" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <stop stop-color="#D1A15B" stop-opacity="0"/>
                <stop offset=".48" stop-color="#D1A15B"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#D1A15B" stop-opacity=".04"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <linearGradient id="signal-cool" x1="93" y1="410" x2="454" y2="90" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <stop stop-color="#738D9D" stop-opacity="0"/>
                <stop offset=".48" stop-color="#738D9D" stop-opacity=".7"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#738D9D" stop-opacity="0"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <pattern id="tiny-grid" width="23" height="23" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <path d="M23 0H0V23" stroke="#E9E2D6" stroke-opacity=".12" stroke-width=".6"/>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <path d="M56 48H485V462H56Z" stroke="#E9E2D6" stroke-opacity=".16"/>
            <path d="M56 48H485V462H56Z" fill="url(#tiny-grid)" opacity=".45"/>
            <path d="M73 343C123 283 128 159 197 140C260 122 281 223 325 215C373 207 381 112 451 106" stroke="#D1A15B" stroke-opacity=".18"/>
            <path d="M68 371C128 312 151 191 207 180C257 171 277 262 331 256C377 250 399 147 470 141" stroke="#D1A15B" stroke-opacity=".3"/>
            <path d="M77 398C144 348 169 230 220 220C267 211 296 296 339 290C392 283 418 181 476 174" stroke="url(#signal-warm)" stroke-width="1.4"/>
            <path d="M69 294C137 330 168 381 224 356C276 333 300 174 352 168C400 162 426 238 476 233" stroke="url(#signal-cool)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <path d="M65 266C133 302 171 351 224 326C281 299 299 144 354 140C401 136 434 214 478 207" stroke="#738D9D" stroke-opacity=".2"/>
            <path d="M66 420H478M66 89H478" stroke="#E9E2D6" stroke-opacity=".11" stroke-dasharray="2 7"/>
            <path d="M113 62V448M431 62V448" stroke="#E9E2D6" stroke-opacity=".09" stroke-dasharray="2 9"/>
            <circle cx="224" cy="356" r="3" fill="#D1A15B"/>
            <circle cx="352" cy="168" r="3" fill="#738D9D"/>
            <circle cx="339" cy="290" r="2" fill="#E9E2D6"/>
            <path d="M224 356L236 343M352 168L365 155" stroke="#D1A15B" stroke-opacity=".7"/>
            <text x="70" y="30" fill="#A6A196" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" letter-spacing="2">FIELD NOTE / 0001</text>
            <text x="477" y="485" text-anchor="end" fill="#A6A196" font-family="monospace" font-size="9" letter-spacing="1.5">OFFSET ≠ FAILURE</text>
            <text x="70" y="520" fill="#A6A196" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" letter-spacing="1.7">INPUT / RESIDUE / RECOVERY</text>
          </svg>
          <div class="entry__field-label entry__field-label--one">01 — input</div>
          <div class="entry__field-label entry__field-label--two">02 — response</div>
          <div class="entry__field-label entry__field-label--three">03 — recovery</div>
        </div>
        <div class="entry__foot">
          <p>236,000+ orders <span>·</span> 134,000+ customers <span>·</span> 6+ years in production work</p>
          <a href="#work" class="entry__down" aria-label="Scroll to selected work">↓</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about section-split" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <div class="section-side">
          <p class="eyebrow">A bit about the work</p>
          <span class="side-note">Not a manifesto.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="section-main">
          <h2 id="about-title" class="section-title distortable" data-alien="true">The demo is the easy part<span class="title-mark">.</span></h2>
          <div class="about__copy">
            <p>Most of my experience starts after launch: traffic spikes, slow queries, payment-gateway quirks, abuse at checkout, and the quiet little bug that only appears when three things happen in the wrong order.</p>
            <p>Not just writing the feature. Figuring out what it does when conditions stop being polite.</p>
            <p lang="bn" class="about__bangla distortable" data-alien="true">সবসময় ঠিক থাকবে — এই আশা করি না। কীভাবে ফিরে আসবে, সেটা ভাবি।</p>
            <p class="about__translation">I don't expect everything to stay perfect. I think about how it recovers.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about__numbers" aria-label="Experience and platform scale">
            <div><strong>236k<span>+</span></strong><small>Orders processed by a production platform</small></div>
            <div><strong>134k<span>+</span></strong><small>Customers served by that platform</small></div>
            <div><strong>200<span>+</span></strong><small>Independent client projects</small></div>
          </div>
          <p class="fine-print">The commerce figures describe the platform I worked on, not orders personally sold by me.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="work section-split" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
        <div class="section-side">
          <p class="eyebrow">The work</p>
          <span class="side-note">Open source where possible.</span>
          <p class="work__side-copy">A few things I made because the usual tool or answer wasn't enough.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="section-main">
          <h2 id="work-title" class="section-title">Some things I've actually <em>built.</em></h2>
          <p class="work__intro">Projects have different shapes. They shouldn't all be forced into the same little card.</p>

          <article class="project project--sentinel" data-entropy-region>
            <div class="project__graphic project__graphic--risk" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="risk-map">
                <span class="risk-map__node risk-map__node--a"></span>
                <span class="risk-map__node risk-map__node--b"></span>
                <span class="risk-map__node risk-map__node--c"></span>
                <span class="risk-map__node risk-map__node--d"></span>
                <span class="risk-map__line risk-map__line--a"></span>
                <span class="risk-map__line risk-map__line--b"></span>
                <span class="risk-map__line risk-map__line--c"></span>
                <span class="risk-map__ring"></span>
                <span class="risk-map__label">checkout / risk surface</span>
              </div>
              <span class="project__graphic-index">SG.01</span>
            </div>
            <div class="project__content">
              <p class="project__meta">PHP / WooCommerce <span>·</span> Public plugin + source</p>
              <h3 class="distortable" data-alien="true">SentinelGuard</h3>
              <p>I built SentinelGuard after seeing the gap between generic WordPress hardening and the things that actually hurt a store at checkout: card testing, fake accounts, skimmer behaviour, and payment flow abuse.</p>
              <p class="project__aside">It starts by observing. Blocking everything is easy; not blocking the wrong customer is the hard part.</p>
              <div class="project__links">
                <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/sentinelguard-ecommerce-protection/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">WordPress.org <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                <a href="https://github.com/Xbot-me/sentinelwp-security" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Source code <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="project project--repo" data-entropy-region>
            <div class="project__graphic project__graphic--graph" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 440 245" class="graph-art">
                <g stroke="#738D9D" stroke-opacity=".47" fill="none" stroke-width="1">
                  <path d="M53 54L142 94L220 42L308 101L386 48M53 54L84 180L190 202L308 101L350 195L386 48M142 94L190 202L220 42L350 195M84 180L142 94L308 101L386 204M190 202L386 204L350 195"/>
                </g>
                <g fill="#111315" stroke="#D1A15B" stroke-width="1.4">
                  <circle cx="53" cy="54" r="7"/><circle cx="142" cy="94" r="5"/><circle cx="220" cy="42" r="8"/><circle cx="308" cy="101" r="7"/><circle cx="386" cy="48" r="5"/><circle cx="84" cy="180" r="5"/><circle cx="190" cy="202" r="8"/><circle cx="350" cy="195" r="6"/><circle cx="386" cy="204" r="5"/>
                </g>
                <circle cx="220" cy="42" r="18" stroke="#D1A15B" stroke-opacity=".25"/>
                <circle cx="190" cy="202" r="18" stroke="#738D9D" stroke-opacity=".28"/>
                <text x="17" y="232" fill="#A6A196" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" letter-spacing="1.5">IMPORTS / SYMBOLS / CONTEXT</text>
              </svg>
              <span class="project__graphic-index">RB.02</span>
            </div>
            <div class="project__content">
              <p class="project__meta">Python / Static analysis <span>·</span> Open source</p>
              <h3 class="distortable" data-alien="true">Repo-Brain</h3>
              <p>A repository is more than a pile of files. Repo-Brain indexes imports and symbols, scores structural importance, and packs useful context for coding agents under a token budget.</p>
              <p class="project__aside">Not magic code understanding. A structural map, with the limits stated clearly.</p>
              <div class="project__links">
                <a href="https://github.com/Xbot-me/repo-brain" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Inspect the repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="project project--deploy" data-entropy-region>
            <div class="project__graphic project__graphic--terminal" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="terminal-sheet">
                <div class="terminal-sheet__top"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>release-notes.txt</span></div>
                <p><span class="terminal-sheet__prompt">›</span> inspect the host</p>
                <p class="terminal-sheet__dim">services / firewall / backups</p>
                <p><span class="terminal-sheet__ok">+</span> snapshot recorded</p>
                <p><span class="terminal-sheet__ok">+</span> rollback remains possible</p>
                <div class="terminal-sheet__rule"></div>
                <small>PulseDeploy — illustrative, not a captured terminal session</small>
              </div>
              <span class="project__graphic-index">PD.03</span>
            </div>
            <div class="project__content">
              <p class="project__meta">Bash / Linux operations <span>·</span> Open source</p>
              <h3 class="distortable" data-alien="true">PulseDeploy</h3>
              <p>A shell toolkit for setting up and operating Linux servers: web stacks, TLS, firewall, backups, deploy and rollback workflows, plus performance tools.</p>
              <p class="project__aside">I like automation that shows its work and gives you a way back.</p>
              <div class="project__links">
                <a href="https://github.com/Xbot-me/PulseDeploy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Inspect the repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="project project--khoj" data-entropy-region>
            <div class="project__graphic project__graphic--paper" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="newspaper-sample">
                <span class="newspaper-sample__index">পাতা / OCR test</span>
                <strong lang="bn">পুরনো পাতার<br/>ভেতর নতুন খোঁজ</strong>
                <span class="newspaper-sample__rule"></span>
                <span class="newspaper-sample__line newspaper-sample__line--long"></span>
                <span class="newspaper-sample__line"></span>
                <span class="newspaper-sample__line newspaper-sample__line--short"></span>
                <span class="newspaper-sample__line newspaper-sample__line--long"></span>
                <small>confidence → review</small>
              </div>
              <span class="project__graphic-index">KB.04</span>
            </div>
            <div class="project__content">
              <p class="project__meta">Python / OCR / Bangla <span>·</span> Open source</p>
              <h3 class="distortable" data-alien="true">KhojBangla</h3>
              <p>Old newspaper scans are messy; OCR can quietly guess wrong. KhojBangla preprocesses pages, separates columns and lines, runs OCR, and sends uncertain output for human review.</p>
              <p class="project__aside">The documented test uses synthetic pages. Real historical scans still need broader validation.</p>
              <div class="project__links">
                <a href="https://github.com/Xbot-me/KhojBangla" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Inspect the repository <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="project project--signal" data-entropy-region>
            <div class="project__graphic project__graphic--signal" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="signal-watch-art" viewBox="0 0 440 245" fill="none">
                <path d="M18 126H422" stroke="#E9E2D6" stroke-opacity=".1" stroke-dasharray="2 7"/>
                <path d="M18 126H78L91 110L105 151L121 84L138 166L155 116L171 126H208L224 65L243 190L259 99L279 140L295 126H328L343 112L359 139L374 126H422" stroke="#D1A15B" stroke-width="1.3"/>
                <path d="M18 138H98L111 130L123 143L139 125L156 135L172 130H222L239 116L254 149L270 126H331L347 121L363 134H422" stroke="#738D9D" stroke-opacity=".65"/>
                <g stroke="#E9E2D6" stroke-opacity=".16">
                  <path d="M78 42V202M138 42V202M198 42V202M258 42V202M318 42V202M378 42V202"/>
                </g>
                <circle cx="224" cy="65" r="4" fill="#D1A15B"/>
                <circle cx="243" cy="190" r="3" fill="#738D9D"/>
                <text x="18" y="25" fill="#A6A196" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" letter-spacing="1.4">VIDEO / SOCKET EVENTS</text>
                <text x="422" y="225" text-anchor="end" fill="#A6A196" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" letter-spacing="1.4">SIGNAL / METRICS / TRACE</text>
              </svg>
              <span class="project__graphic-index">SW.05</span>
            </div>
            <div class="project__content">
              <p class="project__meta">Go / Prometheus / Grafana <span>·</span> Status to confirm</p>
              <h3 class="distortable" data-alien="true">Signal Watch</h3>
              <p>Observability for real-time video and WebSocket workloads: making the health of a live system visible while events are moving through it.</p>
              <p class="project__aside">The current handoff identifies this project, but no public repository or demo link was found. It stays unlinked until there's something safe and verifiable to show.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <div class="project-tail">
            <p>More things from the workshop, less of a sales pitch.</p>
            <div class="project-tail__links">
              <a href="https://github.com/Xbot-me/PerfKit" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">PerfKit <span>↗</span></a>
              <a href="https://github.com/Xbot-me/GeoProspector-AI" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GeoProspector AI <span>↗</span></a>
              <a href="https://github.com/Xbot-me" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Other repositories <span>↗</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="experience section-split" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
        <div class="section-side">
          <p class="eyebrow">Where I learned it</p>
          <span class="side-note">The unglamorous years.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="section-main">
          <h2 id="experience-title" class="section-title">I stayed for the <em>after.</em></h2>
          <div class="experience__item">
            <span class="experience__date">2020 — 2026</span>
            <div>
              <h3>E-commerce & systems development</h3>
              <p class="experience__company">KC Investment LLC / Kpop USA</p>
              <p>Sole technical owner across a high-volume retail operation — application code, WooCommerce, payment integrations, security, databases, deployment, and production support. The operational surface included nine connected services and zero-downtime expectations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="experience__item">
            <span class="experience__date">2019 — now</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Independent projects</h3>
              <p>200+ client projects across e-commerce, CMS work, API integrations, debugging, performance optimization, and production support.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-note">
            <span class="eyebrow">Tools I reach for</span>
            <p>PHP / WordPress / WooCommerce / MySQL / Linux / Docker / Bash / Python / FastAPI / PostgreSQL / Redis / TypeScript / React / Next.js</p>
            <p class="stack-note__aside">Tools change. The responsibility doesn't.</p><p class="stack-note__aside">Currently reading: <em>Designing Data-Intensive Applications</em>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <div class="contact__ghost" aria-hidden="true">?</div>
        <div class="contact__top">
          <p class="eyebrow">That's enough about me.</p>
          <span class="contact__aside" lang="bn">কী ভাঙছে?</span>
        </div>
        <h2 id="contact-title" class="distortable" data-alien="true">What keeps breaking<span class="title-mark">?</span></h2>
        <div class="contact__bottom">
          <p>Tell me what it's doing, what you expected, and what you've already tried. A useful bug report beats a polished pitch.</p>
          <div class="contact__links">
            <a class="contact__email" href="mailto:hello@mustafizur.info">hello@mustafizur.info <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="link-muted" href="https://github.com/Xbot-me" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub profile <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <a class="signature signature--footer" href="#top"><span class="signature__mark" aria-hidden="true">m<span>/</span>r</span><span class="signature__text">Mustafizur Rahman<small>Still trying to get it right.</small></span></a>
      <p>Made by a person. Probably needs another pass.</p>
      <a href="#top" class="back-top">Up again ↑</a>
    </footer>

    <script>
      import { startMotionDirector } from "../lib/motion-director";
      import { startResidualEngine } from "../lib/residual-engine";
      startMotionDirector();
      startResidualEngine();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>